{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>對於需要管理年假、病假、個人假等各種休假天數的上班族來說，DAYOFF 是一款極其實用的私人休假追蹤工具。它不需要註冊帳號、不需要雲端同步，所有資料都安全儲存在你的裝置上。目前這款 App 正進行限時免費，原價 US $1.99，有興趣的讀者把握機會下載。</p>\n\n<h2>三大實用功能</h2>\n<p>DAYOFF 提供即時休假餘額儀表板，讓你一目了然各類假期結餘，並支援智能計算系統自動根據每週、雙週、每月或每年計算應得天數。內建的 Claude AI 假期規劃助手能夠分析你的請假紀錄並建議最佳休假時機，而風險追蹤功能則會提醒你多久沒有使用 PTO，避免過勞。所有操作都支援自然語言輸入，例如輸入「下星期五休假」即可快速記錄。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1320x2868bb-108-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1320x2868bb-109-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1320x2868bb-110-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1320x2868bb-111-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1320x2868bb-112-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1320x2868bb-113-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：DAYOFF – PTO &amp; Vacation Track</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-30T11:58:57.339929+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":365,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}